// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Grafana Alloy Configuration for DREDGE-Cli
// Scrapes local metrics and ships them + logs to Grafana Cloud.
//
// Required environment variables (set before starting alloy):
//   GCLOUD_HOSTED_METRICS_URL  — Prometheus remote-write endpoint
//   GCLOUD_HOSTED_METRICS_ID   — Grafana Cloud metrics instance ID
//   GCLOUD_HOSTED_LOGS_URL     — Loki push endpoint
//   GCLOUD_HOSTED_LOGS_ID      — Grafana Cloud logs instance ID
//   GCLOUD_RW_API_KEY          — Grafana Cloud read/write API key
//   GCLOUD_SCRAPE_INTERVAL     — Scrape interval (e.g. "60s")
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Prometheus metrics scraping
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

prometheus.scrape "dredge_prometheus" {
  targets = [{ "__address__" = "localhost:9090" }]
  scrape_interval = env("GCLOUD_SCRAPE_INTERVAL")
  forward_to = [prometheus.remote_write.grafana_cloud.receiver]

  job_name = "prometheus"
}

prometheus.scrape "dredge_metrics" {
  targets = [{ "__address__" = "localhost:9091", "service" = "dredge-cli" }]
  scrape_interval = env("GCLOUD_SCRAPE_INTERVAL")
  forward_to = [prometheus.remote_write.grafana_cloud.receiver]

  job_name = "dredge-metrics"
}

prometheus.scrape "dredge_server" {
  targets = [{ "__address__" = "localhost:3001", "service" = "dredge-api" }]
  scrape_interval = env("GCLOUD_SCRAPE_INTERVAL")
  forward_to = [prometheus.remote_write.grafana_cloud.receiver]

  job_name = "dredge-server"
}

prometheus.scrape "quasimoto_mcp" {
  targets = [{ "__address__" = "localhost:3002", "service" = "mcp-server" }]
  scrape_interval = env("GCLOUD_SCRAPE_INTERVAL")
  forward_to = [prometheus.remote_write.grafana_cloud.receiver]

  job_name = "quasimoto-mcp"
}

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Prometheus remote write → Grafana Cloud
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

prometheus.remote_write "grafana_cloud" {
  endpoint {
    url = env("GCLOUD_HOSTED_METRICS_URL")

    basic_auth {
      username = env("GCLOUD_HOSTED_METRICS_ID")
      password = env("GCLOUD_RW_API_KEY")
    }
  }

  external_labels = {
    cluster     = "dredge-cli",
    environment = "local",
  }
}

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Log collection → Grafana Cloud Loki
// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

local.file_match "dredge_logs" {
  path_targets = [
    { "__path__" = "/tmp/dredge-cli/*.log", "service" = "dredge-cli" },
    { "__path__" = "/tmp/dredge-server/*.log", "service" = "dredge-api" },
    { "__path__" = "/tmp/quasimoto-mcp/*.log", "service" = "mcp-server" },
  ]
  sync_period = "5s"
}

loki.source.file "dredge_log_files" {
  targets    = local.file_match.dredge_logs.targets
  forward_to = [loki.write.grafana_cloud.receiver]
}

loki.write "grafana_cloud" {
  endpoint {
    url = env("GCLOUD_HOSTED_LOGS_URL")

    basic_auth {
      username = env("GCLOUD_HOSTED_LOGS_ID")
      password = env("GCLOUD_RW_API_KEY")
    }
  }

  external_labels = {
    cluster     = "dredge-cli",
    environment = "local",
  }
}
